#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.add:1 of
msgid "Element-wise addition of ``other`` to the LiteFrame."
msgstr "对 LiteFrame 逐元素添加 ``other``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.add:3 of
msgid ""
"Bound to the ``+`` operator (``__add__``), so ``lf + other`` is "
"equivalent to ``lf.add(other)``."
msgstr ""
"绑定到 ``+`` 运算符（``__add__``），所以 ``lf + other`` 等价于 ``lf.add("
"other)``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.add of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.add:6 of
msgid "Value to add to each element of ``lf``."
msgstr "要添加到 ``lf`` 每个元素的值。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.add of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.add:9 of
msgid "Lazy frame with element-wise sum of ``lf`` and ``other``."
msgstr "包含 ``lf`` 和 ``other`` 逐元素和的惰性框架。"

